## Containers as real elements

{.card}
:::
### Built with `--element card=figure`

This box is a `<figure>` in the output, while the source stays `{.card}` plus a container.
:::

---

## When a slide is broken

{.note}
:::
A source error does not shorten the deck silently. It renders a slide carrying the engine's message, so you see it on the projector instead of wondering where slide nine went. `--strict` fails the build instead.
:::

